<view class="daily-page"><view class="skeleton daily-skeleton" wx:if="{{loading}}"></view><view class="state-panel" wx:elif="{{failed}}"><view class="state-panel__mark">!</view><text class="state-panel__title">学习任务没有加载出来</text><button class="state-panel__action pressable" bindtap="loadPage">重新加载</button></view><block wx:elif="{{!plan}}"><view class="state-panel"><view class="state-panel__mark">＋</view><text class="state-panel__title">还没有可执行的学习计划</text><text class="state-panel__copy">完成诊断后，系统会生成按知识点依赖排序的学习任务。</text><button class="state-panel__action pressable" bindtap="openPlans">查看学习计划</button></view></block><block wx:else><view class="daily-head"><text class="daily-eyebrow">当前计划</text><text class="daily-title">{{plan.name}}</text><button class="daily-plan-link pressable" bindtap="openPlan">查看计划</button></view><view class="daily-empty surface" wx:if="{{!tasks.length}}"><text>学习任务正在生成，完成后会自动显示在这里。</text></view><view class="daily-list surface" wx:else><view class="daily-task" wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id"><view class="daily-task__sequence">{{item.sequenceNo}}</view><view class="daily-task__copy"><text class="daily-task__title">{{item.topicName || '学习任务'}}</text><text class="daily-task__meta">{{item.statusLabel}} · {{item.creditText}}</text></view></view></view><text class="daily-note">课程内容生成前会由服务端进行积分报价和余额校验；尚未生成的任务不会在此页提前扣除积分。</text></block></view>
